WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.591 --> 00:00:09.551
(music)

00:00:11.094 --> 00:00:13.805
(birds chirping)

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:25.025
(rooster crows)

00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:26.610
- Please, Lord,

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:30.072
make me the biggest star
the world has ever known

00:00:30.072 --> 00:00:34.117
so that I make it far,
far away from this place.

00:00:34.117 --> 00:00:35.494
- Now, caring for your family

00:00:35.494 --> 00:00:37.037
during these times is admirable,

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:39.581
but you only get one
take at this life.

00:00:39.581 --> 00:00:41.083
- If only they would just die.

00:00:43.085 --> 00:00:44.711
- Pardon?

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:45.796
- Nothing.

00:00:45.796 --> 00:00:48.590
(boards creaking)

00:00:50.467 --> 00:00:51.468
- [woman, calling]
Peter!

00:00:51.927 --> 00:00:55.430
(alligator growling)

00:00:56.515 --> 00:00:57.599
- I wanna be special,

00:00:57.599 --> 00:00:59.142
dancing up on the screen

00:00:59.142 --> 00:01:00.894
like the pretty
girls in the pictures.

00:01:04.147 --> 00:01:06.692
- I will not let you
leave this farm again.

00:01:14.199 --> 00:01:16.910
I'm worried there may be
something real wrong with me.

00:01:17.953 --> 00:01:19.204
- Rumor has it

00:01:19.204 --> 00:01:20.706
they only take one gal in town.

00:01:21.456 --> 00:01:22.624
- [woman] Next.

00:01:23.625 --> 00:01:25.836
- [man] We are looking for
someone with X factor.

00:01:25.836 --> 00:01:26.670
- Has to be me.

00:01:27.546 --> 00:01:29.882
- How about a film
nobody else has seen?

00:01:29.882 --> 00:01:31.717
- Is it legal?

00:01:31.717 --> 00:01:32.676
- Will be eventually.

00:01:37.973 --> 00:01:39.516
- I know what I've done.

00:01:41.393 --> 00:01:42.227
Bad things.

00:01:44.354 --> 00:01:46.982
Terrible, awful,
murderous things.

00:01:47.774 --> 00:01:48.609
- Help me!

00:01:51.028 --> 00:01:53.864
- I want to be loved from
as many people as possible...

00:01:54.865 --> 00:01:57.242
but truth is I'm not
really a good person.

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:07.961
(screaming)

